  "description": "Driver for LED information boards and variable-message traffic signs speaking the Elitel line protocol over TCP (SET/CLEAR/COLOR/FONT/BRIGHT/PIX, Windows-1250 text). Builds frames from texts, auto-fitted text boxes, zone layouts and rasterised symbols (arrows, lane-closed cross, B-2 no-entry), keeps a registry of boards with change detection, periodic refresh, liveness probing and status events. No dependency on FAS - usable from device-side apps.",
